- The VR fork additions (pc_vr, pc_fp_camera and the VR/first-person hooks in
  decomp files) are licensed under the MIT License below,
  Copyright (c) 2026 LiquidAzir, under the same terms as the PC port
  layer's MIT license text.

- The Apple Vision Pro port (visionos/ except the two directories below, the
  PC_VISIONOS and PC_METAL additions, the OpenGL-on-Metal layer, the Window
  view's capture and the port's other changes) is licensed under the MIT
  License below, Copyright (c) 2026 Trevorbilt, under the same terms as the PC
  port layer's MIT license text.

- The vendored visionOS OpenXR provider (visionos/openxr-provider/) is
